    },
    {
      "item_id": "i11",
      "verdict": "partial",
      "rationale": "The use of Azure through the global datacenter network and the AI supercomputing/AI cloud services portfolio are not quoted. The 'which includes custom-built silicon' excerpt is dangling and lacks its 'hardware' antecedent."
    },
    {
      "item_id": "i12",
      "verdict": "partial",
      "rationale": "The CAL excerpt lacks its CAL subject, and the 132 excerpt starts at 'assist customers' without the enterprise and partner services subject. The full blocks support the claims, but the selected excerpts are incomplete."
    },
    {
